flowchart TB
  CP[ORBIT Control Plane] --> BR[Desktop Session Broker]
  BR <-->|Outbound authenticated WSS / short task leases| NODE[Local Desktop Node]
  NODE --> POLICY[Local Allowlist and Permission Check]
  POLICY --> RUN[Fixed argv subprocess runner]
  RUN --> AD[agent-desktop CLI / optional C FFI]
  AD --> AX[AX API / UI Automation / AT-SPI]
  AX --> APP[Native Desktop Applications]
  BR --> DB[(Device Registry / Leases / Audit)]
  CP --> TG[Central Policy Tool Gateway]
  TG --> AG[Agent Runtime]
  AG --> WF[Durable Workflow Runtime]
